{
  "slug": "memoriant-governance-compiler-skill",
  "name": "Memoriant Governance Compiler Skill",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Governance policy compiler for Claude Code. Transforms Markdown governance policies into directed acyclic graphs for deterministic evaluation. Detects policy conflicts, traces compliance paths, and generates audit evidence.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **2 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `analyze-graph`, `compile-policy`, `detect-conflicts`, `generate-audit`, `trace-compliance`\n- **Agents** (2): `compliance-evaluator-agent`, `policy-compiler-agent`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install memoriant-governance-compiler-skill@claude-community` from `NathanMaine/memoriant-governance-compiler-skill`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin that transforms natural-language policy documents into executable governance graphs. Compile Markdown policies into typed DAGs, detect policy conflicts, trace compliance paths for specific scenarios, and generate audit evidence packages.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "agent": 2
  },
